<title>SPAIN: Spain's Caja Vasca to launch buy for Bankoa - CNMV.</title>
<headline>Spain's Caja Vasca to launch buy for Bankoa - CNMV.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's savings bank Caja Rural Vasca is lauching a public buy offer of Bankoa for 3,000 pesetas a share, Spain's stock market commission CNMV said on Monday.</p>
<p>In a mandatory disclosure to the CNMV, Caja Rural Vasca said: &quot;The offer will be directed at all the shareholders of the bank for all of its share capital....&quot;</p>
<p>Caja Rural said it would soon begin official proceedings with the CNMV for this offer.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
